{"schema":"hsr-dialogue.v1","entryId":"gold-and-gears","chapterId":"event-rogue-13","referenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","textReferenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","sourceIds":["event-rogue-13"],"missing":0,"rows":[{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-13-talk-403811001-line","entryId":"gold-and-gears","chapterId":"event-rogue-13","missionId":"event-rogue-13","mission":"조각상","scene":"조각상","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"인스머스의 홍암석 사이에서 백석 머리 조각상을 발견한다. 손에 쥐기에 알맞은 사이즈로 석판에 {RUBY_B#「풍요의 에이언즈」}약사라고{RUBY_E#} 새겨져 있는 것을 읽을 수 있다","talkId":403811001,"textHash":"5614478040827800306","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:13/talk-403811001","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"fd868c5a6b141b89","bwikiNextIds":["gold-and-gears-event-rogue-13-talk-403811002-line"],"bwikiPage":"雕像","bwikiRevision":95884,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-8730","bwikiMission":"조각상"},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-13-talk-403811002-line","entryId":"gold-and-gears","chapterId":"event-rogue-13","missionId":"event-rogue-13","mission":"조각상","scene":"조각상","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"충동을 이기지 못한 당신은 조각상을 손에 쥐고 만다. 손바닥 안에서 새로 변화한 조각상은 구상화적인 방식으로 증식과 팽창을 거듭하더니 홍갈색 액체가 되어 손가락 사이로 흘러내린다","talkId":403811002,"textHash":"10821247334240976882","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:13/talk-403811002","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"fd868c5a6b141b89","bwikiNextIds":["gold-and-gears-event-rogue-13-talk-403811003-line"],"bwikiPage":"雕像","bwikiRevision":95884,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-8730","bwikiMission":"조각상"},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-13-talk-403811003-line","entryId":"gold-and-gears","chapterId":"event-rogue-13","missionId":"event-rogue-13","mission":"조각상","scene":"조각상","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"「…부탁하노니… 모두가 원하는 대로… 고통을 치유하고… 함께 공생할 수 있기를……」","talkId":403811003,"textHash":"9626804480509652320","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:13/talk-403811003","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"fd868c5a6b141b89","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"雕像","bwikiRevision":95884,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-8730","bwikiMission":"조각상"},{"id":"gold-and-gears-event-rogue-13-text-995505935441413510-choice","entryId":"gold-and-gears","chapterId":"event-rogue-13","missionId":"event-rogue-13","mission":"조각상","scene":"조각상","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"조각상을 버린다! 결단력 있게, 딱!","talkId":null,"textHash":"995505935441413510","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:13/text-995505935441413510","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"bcc85c040e6430a3","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"雕像","bwikiRevision":95884,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-8730","bwikiMission":"조각상"}],"orderNote":"공식 사건 도감에 귀속된 한국어 원문입니다. BWIKI에서 확인한 모드별 구간만 연결하며 조건·확률·미확인 경계는 이어 붙이지 않습니다.","bwikiBaseOrder":["gold-and-gears-event-rogue-13-talk-403811001-line","gold-and-gears-event-rogue-13-talk-403811002-line","gold-and-gears-event-rogue-13-talk-403811003-line","gold-and-gears-event-rogue-13-text-995505935441413510-choice"],"bwiki":{"matchedRows":0,"cachedRows":4,"reviewRows":0,"segments":2,"reorderedRows":0},"retainedTextRowIds":[]}